00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:11.037
Did it seem quiet before the

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.371
former president posted on truth

00:00:12.705 --> 00:00:13.739
social that he has in fact been

00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:14.974
told that he has been indicted

00:00:15.107 --> 00:00:16.042
here?

00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:18.010
&gt;&gt; Yeah, kaitlan, it is very

00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:19.078
quiet here.

00:00:19.211 --> 00:00:21.681
It is only really a handful of

00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:23.115
media that were still in place

00:00:23.249 --> 00:00:24.317
when trump made that posting.

00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:26.319
I mean, all day it was pretty

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:26.752
quiet.

00:00:26.752 --> 00:00:28.087
Well did see some of the key

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.488
prosecutors who were on the

00:00:29.622 --> 00:00:30.723
