00:00:38.731 --> 00:00:40.199
And then we also had heard at

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:41.634
the end of the day, after

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:42.902
everyone had gone that there

00:00:43.035 --> 00:00:45.304
were a bunch of pizza boxes back

00:00:45.438 --> 00:00:46.739
